#. module: odossey_purchase_pos_payment_partial
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:odossey_purchase_pos_payment_partial.field_pos_supplier_credit__account_payment_id
msgid ""
"The real, already-posted outbound payment whose leftover, unreconciled "
"residual this credit actually is. Using this credit later reconciles against"
" THIS SAME payment -- it never creates a new bank/cash movement, since the "
"money was already sent to the supplier when this payment was made."
msgstr ""
"El pago saliente real, ya confirmado, cuyo residual sin conciliar es "
"exactamente este crédito. Usar este crédito más adelante concilia contra "
"ESE MISMO pago, nunca crea un nuevo movimiento bancario/de caja, ya que el "
"dinero ya fue enviado al proveedor cuando se realizó ese pago."

